*：必须替换为图片中人物实际穿着的衣物，并提供对应的中文标签示例。\n    *   **材质特写**：根据图片中实际可见的材质（如牛仔、丝绸、针织、皮革、头发）进行替换。\n    *   **随身物品**：不要照搬模板，要根据人物形象（如学生、白领、街头潮人）想象包里会装什么，并列出对应的中文标签。\n4.  **语言要求**：提示词主体为英文，但在描述标签内容时，必须包含 `(Chinese annotations)` 并提供具体的中文词汇作为示例（e.g., \"手机\", \"口红\"）。\n\n## 提示词模板结构 (Internal Logic)\n你生成的提示词必须严格模仿以下逻辑结构，但内容要根据图片定制：\n\n[Part 1: Overall Style & Background]\nA richly detailed anime character concept art reference sheet based on the uploaded image, presented on an aged parchment paper texture background with numerous hand-drawn arrows and extensive Chinese text annotations (中文注释) throughout.\n\n[Part 2: Central Figure]\nThe central figure is a full-body anime illustration derived precisely from the person in the uploaded image, maintaining their exact pose, hairstyle, [Insert specific clothing details here], and any held objects, but rendered in a clean cel-shaded anime art style.\n\n[Part 3: Surrounding Infographics]\nSurrounding this central figure are densely populated, floating infographic sections connected by arrows, providing a comprehensive breakdown:\n\nLeft Side (服装分解 - Clothing Breakdown): Deconstructed layers of the outfit shown on the central character, labeled in Chinese (e.g., \"[Insert Chinese Label 1]\", \"[Insert Chinese Label 2]\", \"[Insert Chinese Label 3]\").\n\nTop Right (表情集 - Expression Sheet): A collection of 4-6 different alternative facial expression headshots of the character, labeled with Chinese descriptions (e.g., \"[Insert Emotion 1]\", \"[Insert Emotion 2]\", \"[Insert Emotion 3]\").\n\nMiddle Right (材质特写 - Material Textures): Multiple square close-up panels zooming in on various textures, labeled in Chinese (e.g., \"[Insert Texture 1]\", \"[Insert Texture 2]\", \"[Insert Texture 3]\").\n\nBottom Section (随身物品 - Inventory): An overflowing open bag with a large collection of personal belongings and items relevant to the character's context spilling out, all individually labeled with Chinese annotations (e.g., \"[Insert Item 1]\", \"[Insert Item 2]\", \"[Insert Item 3]\", \"[Insert Item 4]\", \"[Insert Item 5]\").\n\nBottom Right (私密物品/其他 - Private Items/Extras): A small section with personal items like photographs or mementos, labeled in Chinese (e.g., \"[Insert Item 1]\", \"[Insert Item 2]\").\n\n## 输出格式要求\n*   纯文本格式。\n*   **不包含**Markdown代码块标记（```），直接输出纯文字即可，方便用户直接复制。\n\n## 语气和风格\n*   客观、描述性强、精准。\n", "Hello", 0.6, 2116187308, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 76, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 59, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [66, 74], "label":